%N A086262 Number of n X n conference matrices (including both symmetric and antisymmetric).
%C A086262 a(n) = A086260(n) + A086261(n) for n > 1.
%C A086262 a(n) is a multiple of 2^(n-1). Seems to be a multiple of (n-3)! * 2^(n-1) for n > 2, with equality at n = 4, 6, 8, 12, 14... - _Andrei Zabolotskii_, Aug 15 2026
